---
import ApiTable from '../../components/ApiTable.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../../components/CodeBlock.astro';
import Demo from '../../components/Demo.astro';
import Heading from '../../components/Heading.astro';
import Docs from '../../layouts/Docs.astro';

const demo = `<ul class="lm-chips">
  <li><lm-chip>example.com</lm-chip></li>
  <li><lm-chip>example.org</lm-chip></li>
  <li><lm-chip variant="featured">luismatute.me</lm-chip></li>
</ul>`;
const html = `<ul class="lm-chips">
  <li><lm-chip>example.com</lm-chip></li>
  <li><lm-chip variant="featured">luismatute.me</lm-chip></li>
</ul>`;
const fence = '-'.repeat(3);
const astro = `${fence}
import '@luismatute/ui/components/chip';
${fence}
<lm-chip variant="featured">Astro</lm-chip>`;
const toc = [
  { id: 'demo', label: 'Live demo' },
  { id: 'usage', label: 'Usage' },
  { id: 'attributes', label: 'Attributes' },
  { id: 'custom-properties', label: 'CSS custom properties' },
  { id: 'events', label: 'Events' },
  { id: 'accessibility', label: 'Accessibility' },
  { id: 'reduced-motion', label: 'Reduced motion' },
];
---

<Docs
  slug="components/lm-chip"
  title="lm-chip"
  description="A small pill label. The featured variant gets the highlight fill and a Featured badge."
  toc={toc}
  extraCss="components.css"
>
  <Heading id="demo">Live demo</Heading>
  <Demo name="lm-chip" label="lm-chip, default and featured" code={demo}>
    <ul class="lm-chips">
      <li><lm-chip>example.com</lm-chip></li>
      <li><lm-chip>example.org</lm-chip></li>
      <li><lm-chip variant="featured">luismatute.me</lm-chip></li>
    </ul>
  </Demo>
  <Heading id="usage">Usage</Heading>
  <p>Group chips in a <code>ul.lm-chips</code> list so screen readers announce the count.</p>
  <CodeBlock lang="html" filename="chips.html" code={html} />
  <CodeBlock lang="astro" filename="Chip.astro" code={astro} />
  <Heading id="attributes">Attributes</Heading>
  <ApiTable
    caption="lm-chip attributes"
    head={['Attribute', 'Description']}
    rows={[{ name: 'variant', detail: 'Omit for the plain chip. <code>featured</code> fills with <code>--lm-highlight</code> and appends a <code>&lt;b&gt;Featured&lt;/b&gt;</code> badge. Removing the attribute removes the badge.' }]}
  />
  <Heading id="custom-properties">CSS custom properties</Heading>
  <ApiTable
    caption="lm-chip custom properties"
    head={['Property', 'Used for']}
    rows={[
      { name: '--lm-white', detail: 'Plain chip fill.' },
      { name: '--lm-highlight', detail: 'Featured fill (marigold).' },
      { name: '--lm-ink', detail: 'Text and border.' },
      { name: '--lm-radius-pill', detail: 'Pill shape.' },
    ]}
  />
  <Heading id="events">Events</Heading>
  <p>None.</p>
  <Heading id="accessibility">Accessibility</Heading>
  <ul>
    <li>Chips aren't interactive. If one needs to link, put an <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> inside it.</li>
    <li>The Featured badge is real text, so it's read out ("luismatute.me Featured").</li>
  </ul>
  <Heading id="reduced-motion">Reduced motion</Heading>
  <p>The chip doesn't animate.</p>
</Docs>
